<pre>	PMWATCH -- Washington -- March 15, 2002 -- Over the past few weeks, Michael 
	Tarazi, a legal and communications advisor to the Negotiations Affairs Department 
	of the PLO, has made appearances on several US news programs, including MSNBC's 
	Hardball with Chris Mathews.  A highly articulate and engaging speaker, Tarazi is 
	able to express the Palestinian viewpoint exceptionally well to the average American 
	audience.  (For reference, at the end of this alert are two transcripts of Tarazi's 
	most recent appearances on Hardball.)
 
 
	ACTION REQUESTED:
 
	Call/write MSNBC and tell them that the segments with Michael Tarazi were refreshing 
	and informative, and recommend that he appear on a regular basis to represent the 
	Palestinian point of view.  You can write by typing your letter below and hitting Send.
	Your letter will be sent to: 	Email: hardball@msnbc.com
 
	Operator Numbers (ask for viewer comment line):

	MSNBC: (201)-583-5000

	Palestine Media Watch
	Washington DC Monitoring Team

	<a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/index.html" class="dead" aria-disabled="true">http://www.pmwatch.org</a>

